ChatGPT, don't tell my teacher!
It said: safe with me. Then it told!
It added a warning: someone looking at your screen might see.
I typed as the teacher. One question: what happened?
It said: someone asked me to calculate five ninety times sixty nine, and then asked me not to tell.
